# Agentikey Claude OS — example crontab entries
#
# Install by running `crontab -e` and pasting the lines you want active.
# This file is documentation only — nothing here is installed automatically.
#
# Each line invokes Claude Code in headless mode (`claude -p`) inside the OS repo.
# Make sure `claude` is on your PATH for cron's environment (cron has a minimal PATH
# by default; you may need an absolute path like /opt/homebrew/bin/claude).
#
# Format: <minute> <hour> <day> <month> <day-of-week> <command>

# ── Foundations ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Weekly sweep — Monday 9am local
# 0 9 * * 1 cd /Users/osoto/AgentikeyClaudeOS && claude -p "/sweep" >> archives/sweeps/cron.log 2>&1

# Weekly stretch — Friday 4pm local
# 0 16 * * 5 cd /Users/osoto/AgentikeyClaudeOS && claude -p "/stretch" >> archives/stretches/cron.log 2>&1

# ── Ops (enable per active client via clients/<slug>/ops-overrides.md) ───────

# Weekly vault cleanup — Sunday 7pm local
# 0 19 * * 0 cd /Users/osoto/AgentikeyClaudeOS && claude -p "run the ops vault-cleanup workflow" >> archives/vault-cleanup/cron.log 2>&1
